<title>USA: N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</title>
<headline>N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York metals futures were called to open by traders as follows:</p>
<p>COMEX June gold - flat to off $0.50 an ounce</p>
<p>COMEX July silver - flat</p>
<p>NYMEX July platinum - flat to down $0.50</p>
<p>NYMEX June palladium - unchanged</p>
<p>COMEX July copper - unchanged</p>
<p>((--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
